Rules:
  [P1] Use DDD for complex domains.
  [P2] Use CQRS for write/read separation.
  [P3] Use Event Sourcing for audit trails.
  [P4] Use hexagonal architecture.
  [P5] Use message brokers for async.
  [P6] Use API Platform for HATEOAS.
  [P7] Use static analysis (Psalm, PHPStan).
  [P8] Use property testing (Infection for mutation).

Pros:
  - Maintainable architecture
  - Testable code
  - Clear separation

Cons:
  - Complexity
  - Learning curve
  - More code

Alternatives:
  - Go (simpler)
  - Java (enterprise standard)

